{"ref":"BDB, רְחוּם","hw":"רְחוּם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רְחוּם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְחֻם</span></big>  <strong>n. pr. m. (</strong><em>compassion</em>, or <em>softness, gentleness</em>?<strong>)</strong>;—post-exilic name:<br><strong>1.</strong>  with Zerub.: <strong>a.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">רְחוּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:2\" href=\"/Ezra.2.2\">Ezr 2:2</a>, A Ιρεουμʼ, 𝔊L Ναουμ (= <span dir=\"rtl\">נְחוּם</span> ‖ <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.7\">Ne 7:7</a>). <strong>b.</strong>  priest, <span dir=\"rtl\">רְחֻם</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.3\">Ne 12:3</a> Ρεουμ (= <span dir=\"rtl\">חָרִם</span> v <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.15\">15</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:41\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.41\">7:42</a> = <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:39\" href=\"/Ezra.2.39\">Ezr 2:39</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:21\" href=\"/Ezra.10.21\">Ezr 10:21</a>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָרִם\" href=\"/BDB,_חָרִם\", dir=\"rtl\">חָרִם</a> <strong>3a</strong>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">רְחוּם</span>, with Neh.: <strong>a.</strong>  Levite <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.17\">Ne 3:17</a>, Βασουθ, א A 𝔊L Ραουμ. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:26\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.26\">Ne 10:26</a>, Ρα[ε]ουμ.","next":"BDB, יְרֹחָם²","prev":"BDB, רֻחָ֫מָה"}